{"id": "3326603", "name": "אינטגרלים משולשים – חישוב בתחום מדורג", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_POLISHED_Q8_V2\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">אינטגרל משולש – חישוב מדורג</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div>יהי</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle E= \\left\\{ (x,y,z): 0\\le x\\le{{CT:0}},\\ 0\\le y\\le{{CT:1}},\\ 0\\le z\\le{{CT:2}} \\right\\} \\)</div>\n<div>חשבו את האינטגרל המשולש</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 19px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\iiint_E {{CT:3}}\\,dV \\)</div>\n<div>נחשב בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dz\\,dy\\,dx\\)</span>. כתבו תחילה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle I= \\int_0^{{{CT:0}}} \\int_0^{c(x)} \\int_0^{d(y)} {{CT:3}}\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx \\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">א. הגבולות התלויים</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(240px,360px)); gap: 12px; justify-content: center; align-items: start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle c(x)=\\)[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle d(y)=\\)[[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">ב. לאחר האינטגרציה לפי \\(z\\)</div>\n<div>נסמן את תוצאת האינטגרציה הפנימית ב־ <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle J_1(x,y)\\)</span>:</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle J_1(x,y) = \\int_0^{d(y)} {{CT:3}}\\,dz \\)</div>\n<div style=\"max-width: 430px; margin: 10px auto 0; background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle J_1(x,y)=\\)[[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">ג. לאחר האינטגרציה לפי \\(y\\)</div>\n<div>כעת נסמן את תוצאת האינטגרציה השנייה ב־ <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle J_2(x)\\)</span>:</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle J_2(x) = \\int_0^{c(x)} J_1(x,y)\\,dy \\)</div>\n<div style=\"max-width: 430px; margin: 10px auto 0; background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle J_2(x)=\\)[[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">ד. האינטגרציה האחרונה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle I= \\int_0^{{{CT:0}}} J_2(x)\\,dx \\)</div>\n<div style=\"max-width: 320px; margin: 10px auto 0; background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\)[[input:ans5]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"position: absolute; left: -10000px; top: auto; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> </span></p>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_EXTRA_DOUBLE_V3_PRESERVE_PRTS\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px;